WEBVTT

00:02.150 --> 00:03.290
Welco—

00:05.370 --> 00:06.510
Karin-chan...

00:07.060 --> 00:08.380
It's been a while.

00:09.680 --> 00:10.840
Where's Kazuki?

00:19.410 --> 00:21.550
Rainy-rainy day-day!

00:21.550 --> 00:23.720
Papa Kazu's here!

00:23.720 --> 00:25.940
He came to pick me up

00:25.940 --> 00:27.770
with an umbrella, so let's cheer!

00:27.770 --> 00:29.630
Wishy-washy, splishy-splashy!

00:28.690 --> 00:29.630
Hey, don't—

00:29.630 --> 00:31.750
La, la, la!

00:36.440 --> 00:37.540
Miri!

01:00.740 --> 01:03.910
This was my favorite one, too!

01:03.910 --> 01:06.300
Hey, c'mon, these things happen.

01:06.300 --> 01:08.720
I'll buy you a new one soon.

01:08.720 --> 01:09.600
Let's go home.

01:10.070 --> 01:11.120
Okay...

01:15.880 --> 01:18.360
<i>Not my favorite time of year.</i>

01:20.350 --> 01:23.890
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

01:23.890 --> 01:27.520
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

01:27.520 --> 01:29.770
<i>What should I do?</i>

01:29.770 --> 01:32.150
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

01:35.440 --> 01:38.450
<i>As usual, the whole city</i>

01:38.450 --> 01:42.120
<i>Is madly in love and excited</i>

01:42.120 --> 01:45.660
<i>Extras like me just go home</i>

01:45.660 --> 01:48.960
<i>But I'm not sulking at all</i>

01:48.960 --> 01:52.800
<i>"And then you appeared suddenly</i>

01:52.800 --> 01:56.340
<i>As though you were ripping 
through those days</i>

01:56.340 --> 01:59.930
<i>With your smile that leaves me numb</i>

01:59.930 --> 02:04.260
<i>You shattered my heart</i>

02:05.430 --> 02:09.020
<i>Hey, I want to love, is this true love?</i>

02:09.020 --> 02:12.650
<i>Is just wanting to be loved insincere?</i>

02:12.650 --> 02:14.820
<i>What should I do?</i>

02:14.820 --> 02:17.150
<i>Oh, what should I do?</i>

02:17.440 --> 02:19.530
<i>How the heck should I know?</i>

02:19.530 --> 02:23.370
<i>I don't know what's going on in your head</i>

02:23.370 --> 02:27.040
<i>But it's not fair that you're so friendly</i>

02:27.040 --> 02:31.750
<i>Once again, I'm being 
swallowed up by your rhythm</i>

02:33.920 --> 02:38.590
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

02:44.890 --> 02:49.770
<i>There you go, you've got me 
wrapped around your finger again</i>

02:50.330 --> 02:52.520
We're back!

02:52.520 --> 02:55.420
Papa Rei! We're back!

02:55.420 --> 02:57.030
Miri, raincoat off!

02:57.430 --> 02:58.740
Oh, for...

02:58.740 --> 03:01.210
Rei, I need a towel!

03:06.580 --> 03:07.950
Welcome back.

03:07.950 --> 03:09.920
Need! A! Towel!

03:09.920 --> 03:11.570
I wanna play!

03:11.570 --> 03:13.030
No! Bath first!

03:17.760 --> 03:19.300
Oh, come on!

03:27.560 --> 03:29.920
Thank you for the food!

03:29.920 --> 03:30.810
Same.

03:32.230 --> 03:33.840
Hey, hey! Papa Rei!

03:33.840 --> 03:35.530
Can we play more <i>Morio Kart</i>?

03:35.530 --> 03:38.280
No way. You get mad when you lose.

03:38.280 --> 03:41.250
I won't get mad!

03:43.830 --> 03:44.720
Hey, hey!

03:44.720 --> 03:46.360
Where's the big towel?

03:47.250 --> 03:48.810
Big towel?

03:48.810 --> 03:50.910
The one I gotta take to daycare.

03:50.910 --> 03:52.400
Oh, that one.

03:52.710 --> 03:53.630
Hey, Rei.

03:53.630 --> 03:55.840
Where's the terrycloth blanket 
with her name on it?

03:55.840 --> 03:57.160
I told you to get it, remember?

04:00.580 --> 04:02.800
Rei! Earth to Rei!

04:07.220 --> 04:09.250
Oh, come on...

04:13.530 --> 04:17.720
Where's that sewing kit...

04:24.050 --> 04:26.070
I'm out of the bath!

04:26.070 --> 04:29.260
Great! Did you dry your hair real good?

04:28.500 --> 04:32.010
Papa Rei! Can I play <i>Morio Kart</i>, too?

04:38.630 --> 04:40.000
C'mon, Rei.

04:39.340 --> 04:42.130
<b>Unasaka Miri</b>

04:40.000 --> 04:42.120
You gotta step up with taking care of Miri.

04:42.120 --> 04:44.560
Um, I am?

04:44.560 --> 04:46.660
<i>Are</i> you? How?

04:47.440 --> 04:50.370
We play games together and stuff.

04:51.860 --> 04:55.690
It's not like you leave 
the house anyway, dude.

04:55.690 --> 04:59.670
You could help me out a little 
more with Miri stuff.

04:59.670 --> 05:01.530
I'm doing my best.

05:05.630 --> 05:07.030
<i>Sheesh...</i>

05:07.460 --> 05:09.110
<i>Something's gotta give here.</i>

05:15.690 --> 05:17.830
<i>What's she doing here?</i>

05:17.830 --> 05:19.790
If it isn't Kazu-kun.

05:19.790 --> 05:22.550
What brings you to this part of town?

05:22.550 --> 05:23.800
Hush!

05:23.800 --> 05:25.890
We've been lonely without you!

05:25.890 --> 05:27.290
Come play, okay?

05:27.290 --> 05:28.560
U-Um, I...

05:29.270 --> 05:32.060
Sorry, I've got a prior engagement...

05:32.060 --> 05:34.670
We haven't seen you in forever!

05:35.410 --> 05:38.560
You didn't get a proper sweetheart, did you?

05:39.860 --> 05:42.560
Aw, say it ain't so!

05:42.560 --> 05:45.600
Sorry. I've really got plans...

05:46.170 --> 05:48.110
Make each other happy!

05:53.830 --> 05:56.330
Happy, huh?

05:57.210 --> 06:01.640
Do the laundry, wash the dishes,
 make dinner,

06:01.640 --> 06:02.860
get her a bath...

06:02.860 --> 06:05.560
Do the laundry, wash the dishes...

06:06.340 --> 06:09.440
Is this supposed to be "happy"?

06:09.960 --> 06:15.190
I want ups! C'mon!

06:12.630 --> 06:15.190
Stop pulling at me. It's not safe.

06:15.190 --> 06:19.510
Ups! I want ups!

06:21.180 --> 06:23.990
Why won't you play with me?

06:26.590 --> 06:29.470
Rei! Get out here!

06:29.470 --> 06:32.120
Ups, Papa!

06:32.120 --> 06:33.200
Darn it!

06:33.200 --> 06:35.120
Fine, fine, fine!

06:35.120 --> 06:36.450
I'm on my way!

06:44.450 --> 06:46.530
I don't like these.

06:46.860 --> 06:49.220
Papa Rei, you eat it.

06:49.220 --> 06:51.330
I don't like tomatoes.

06:51.330 --> 06:53.230
Me neither!

06:53.230 --> 06:54.600
Happy, huh?

06:56.140 --> 06:57.670
What's that even mean?

06:58.500 --> 07:00.390
How'd I get more?!

07:00.390 --> 07:02.500
I can't stand mushrooms.

07:02.500 --> 07:04.120
I don't want them!

07:04.120 --> 07:05.390
Well, neither do I.

07:05.390 --> 07:06.620
No! You gotta eat them!

07:06.620 --> 07:08.170
The tomatoes, too!

07:08.170 --> 07:09.760
Hey, don't be gross—

07:11.130 --> 07:14.650
If you hate it that much, 
you don't have to eat it.

07:14.650 --> 07:17.720
I could eat sweet stuff!

07:17.720 --> 07:19.200
Oh, hey, same.

07:20.030 --> 07:22.040
I want French toast!

07:22.040 --> 07:23.910
Hey, sounds good.

07:23.910 --> 07:25.220
Simple, too.

07:25.220 --> 07:27.200
Simple?!

07:27.200 --> 07:30.350
Papa Kazuki, make French toast!

07:31.940 --> 07:33.150
Do you guys...

07:34.010 --> 07:35.470
...think I'm...

07:36.050 --> 07:38.310
...your <i>maid</i> or something?!

07:46.650 --> 07:49.100
What's a maid?

07:49.100 --> 07:51.900
Like an assistant, I guess?

07:56.630 --> 08:00.580
Papa! Papa Rei!

08:02.450 --> 08:05.620
I'm hungry!

08:06.350 --> 08:07.550
Where's Kazuki?

08:07.550 --> 08:10.320
I can't find him.

08:12.170 --> 08:15.180
<b>I'll be out for a while.
- Kazuki</b>

08:20.060 --> 08:22.840
I'm hungry!

08:22.840 --> 08:26.010
Papa Rei! Make food!

08:30.930 --> 08:34.440
Food, food, food!

08:31.700 --> 08:33.860
Which is the food?

08:39.370 --> 08:41.460
It's so good!

08:41.460 --> 08:43.500
Yeah. And it's been a while.

08:43.500 --> 08:47.180
Papa Kazuki won't let us eat it!

08:47.180 --> 08:49.170
Yeah, even though it's good.

08:50.330 --> 08:52.670
Hey, don't I go to daycare today?

08:58.270 --> 08:59.960
Um...

09:00.530 --> 09:02.230
What do you need to take?

09:02.230 --> 09:03.090
That.

09:03.730 --> 09:05.730
<b>Notebook
Change of clothes
Bag for dirties
Bath towel
Hand towel</b>

09:08.720 --> 09:11.380
Papa, hurry!

09:11.380 --> 09:12.980
Getting there...

09:16.580 --> 09:17.790
Where's your umbrella?

09:17.790 --> 09:19.280
It got broken.

09:19.280 --> 09:20.000
Huh?

09:22.490 --> 09:24.880
So fast! So cold!

09:28.550 --> 09:29.810
I see.

09:30.510 --> 09:33.010
So you ran off early this morning?

09:33.010 --> 09:37.310
It's the only way to get 
Rei to look after Miri.

09:37.310 --> 09:41.510
And Miri needs to appreciate 
how much I do for her.

09:41.510 --> 09:44.630
I do all the damn washing 
and all the damn laundry

09:44.630 --> 09:46.680
and all they do is play games all day!

09:46.680 --> 09:48.640
Then they bitch about my food!

09:49.920 --> 09:51.130
What?

09:51.130 --> 09:53.910
Sounds like you're having fun.

09:53.910 --> 09:55.280
What part of that sounds fun?

09:56.050 --> 09:58.020
You've really changed.

09:59.570 --> 10:01.250
Where are you getting that?

10:01.480 --> 10:04.080
Your sister-in-law returned it again.

10:04.080 --> 10:05.960
I'm pretty sure she won't take it.

10:07.270 --> 10:09.180
You really need to talk this out with her.

10:09.620 --> 10:12.760
Karin-chan is Yuzuko-chan's 
only living family.

10:13.090 --> 10:14.320
It's been five years.

10:14.750 --> 10:16.700
The anniversary's soon too, right?

10:17.210 --> 10:18.710
You need to get over—

10:18.970 --> 10:23.440
Welp, maybe I'll treat myself 
to a day on the town.

10:23.440 --> 10:24.210
Kazuki...

10:24.470 --> 10:25.450
Later.

10:30.690 --> 10:33.120
Nothing's changed. Damn it.

10:42.910 --> 10:46.140
Let's see, where'll I live it up first?

10:51.000 --> 10:54.270
Huh? How come no one's here?

10:54.850 --> 10:56.750
Where's Anna-chan?

11:07.120 --> 11:08.640
Hell yeah!

11:08.640 --> 11:10.240
I'm on a hot streak!

11:10.240 --> 11:13.280
Oh, Kazu-kun's on fire today!

11:13.280 --> 11:15.060
Definitely hot!

11:15.830 --> 11:17.640
This rocks!

11:18.820 --> 11:20.390
I'm exhausted.

11:21.610 --> 11:23.620
Yeah! Take off!

11:23.620 --> 11:25.180
Oh, I got past!

11:25.180 --> 11:26.210
Wait for me!

11:26.540 --> 11:28.070
Go through!

11:30.210 --> 11:32.830
A toast to Kazu-kun's hot streak!

11:32.830 --> 11:35.120
Cheers!

11:34.180 --> 11:36.360
You girls order whatever you want!

11:36.360 --> 11:38.020
Keep the party train chugging!

11:38.020 --> 11:39.260
I want pizza!

11:39.260 --> 11:40.980
Aw, that's for poor people!

11:40.980 --> 11:42.770
Someone order sushi!

11:45.690 --> 11:48.520
I'm hungry!

11:48.520 --> 11:49.470
Huh?

11:49.470 --> 11:50.780
Um...

11:51.170 --> 11:52.620
Should I get a pizza?

11:52.620 --> 11:54.500
Pizza! Yes!

11:56.090 --> 11:59.070
One medium supreme, please.

11:59.070 --> 12:00.800
No tomatoes or green peppers.

12:00.800 --> 12:05.290
Papa Kazuki says we gotta eat our veggies!

12:05.690 --> 12:07.500
Add an order of fries.

12:12.180 --> 12:15.030
Been a while since I got hella drunk...

12:17.170 --> 12:20.190
How'd it get to be so late?

12:21.610 --> 12:25.010
Mama's gonna be so mad if we don't get back!

12:25.010 --> 12:26.220
Sorry, sorry.

12:29.770 --> 12:32.300
Family, my—

12:33.460 --> 12:35.520
Watch it, buddy.

12:36.600 --> 12:37.700
And who're you, exactly?

12:48.310 --> 12:49.910
I'm done!

12:50.420 --> 12:53.560
Papa Kazuki's still not back?

12:55.210 --> 12:58.960
<b>I'll be out for a while.
- Kazuki</b>

12:55.660 --> 12:56.680
Miri...

12:57.200 --> 12:58.680
I think...

12:59.140 --> 13:00.690
We've been abandoned.

13:04.430 --> 13:06.450
Watch your mouth next time, buddy.

13:10.560 --> 13:13.410
Shoulda told me he had friends...

13:13.770 --> 13:14.720
Ow...

13:14.720 --> 13:20.030
Guess someone as lame as me 
belongs in the trash, huh?

13:20.640 --> 13:23.390
It's always the ones with 
the loftiest ideals

13:23.390 --> 13:25.520
who bring the greatest 
misfortune to their families.

13:26.840 --> 13:28.260
Pathetic.

13:29.590 --> 13:30.930
Are you all right?

13:36.540 --> 13:38.750
Yuzuko...

13:41.730 --> 13:43.900
You okay, Kazuki?

13:44.440 --> 13:45.610
Karin...

13:45.610 --> 13:47.220
Finally found you.

13:48.010 --> 13:50.080
Yeah. Been a while, huh?

13:50.080 --> 13:51.570
How've you been?

13:51.570 --> 13:54.470
What the heck are you doing out here?

13:54.470 --> 13:57.210
All beat up, dumped in the garbage...

13:57.210 --> 13:58.370
You look like an idiot.

13:58.810 --> 14:00.550
No one asked you.

14:00.950 --> 14:04.280
Hang on. Yadorigi's owner 
told me everything.

14:04.280 --> 14:05.160
We need to talk—

14:05.160 --> 14:07.200
Nah. Next time, maybe.

14:09.050 --> 14:10.600
Don't you run away on me, Kazuki!

14:11.360 --> 14:13.250
Get a grip already!

14:13.250 --> 14:16.930
You can't just keep sending 
money and avoiding me!

14:16.930 --> 14:19.510
I don't know what line of work you're in,

14:19.510 --> 14:21.950
but I can't accept that money, 
no matter how much it is.

14:21.950 --> 14:23.230
And I don't need it anyway!

14:23.830 --> 14:25.320
Sure. Sorry.

14:25.940 --> 14:27.160
I'll stop, then.

14:27.710 --> 14:28.520
Bye.

14:28.710 --> 14:31.750
It's not like it's your fault 
my sister died, right?

14:32.370 --> 14:33.680
How long are you going to—

14:33.920 --> 14:35.300
No, I killed her.

14:52.700 --> 14:53.550
Damn it!

14:54.690 --> 14:55.850
Outta the way!

15:20.640 --> 15:21.230
Yuz—

15:48.720 --> 15:50.460
Too hot...

15:54.090 --> 15:55.230
What the...

15:57.860 --> 15:59.500
Are you sick?

16:00.610 --> 16:01.890
Kazuki!

16:12.930 --> 16:15.310
38.5...

16:21.400 --> 16:23.040
Why won't he pick up?

16:23.520 --> 16:25.900
It's hot...

16:25.900 --> 16:27.090
Hang on.

16:28.300 --> 16:29.300
Medicine!

16:31.800 --> 16:32.680
<b>All-Purpose

Cold Medicine</b>

16:31.800 --> 16:32.680
<b>Cough • Phlegm</b>

16:31.840 --> 16:32.680
<b>Relieves General Cold Symptoms</b>

16:31.840 --> 16:32.680
<b>Sore Throat</b>

16:31.840 --> 16:32.680
<b>Fever • Runny Nose</b>

16:31.880 --> 16:32.680
<b>44  powder packets</b>

16:36.470 --> 16:38.970
<b>Age 12-14</b>

16:36.470 --> 16:38.970
<b>2/3rd Package</b>

16:36.470 --> 16:38.970
<b>12 and Under</b>

16:36.470 --> 16:38.970
<b>Not Recommended</b>

16:36.750 --> 16:38.440
No way...

16:39.950 --> 16:41.310
Damn it.

16:41.310 --> 16:44.000
I can't do anything.

16:44.000 --> 16:46.090
Papa Rei.

16:48.680 --> 16:49.790
Miri...

16:50.300 --> 16:51.490
Hospital...

16:57.490 --> 17:00.280
Where... is the hospital?

17:06.980 --> 17:10.230
Don't worry. I haven't forgotten.

17:26.090 --> 17:27.630
Kyutaro-san...

17:27.630 --> 17:28.730
Help me.

17:53.940 --> 17:55.670
Are you all right?

18:01.930 --> 18:04.990
Big Sis really liked this place, huh?

18:12.770 --> 18:16.340
It's the place you guys first met, right?

18:18.760 --> 18:23.210
Look... I really loved my sister.

18:24.410 --> 18:27.290
When she told me you guys 
were gonna get married,

18:27.290 --> 18:29.330
I was super happy for her.

18:29.850 --> 18:30.620
I'm sorry.

18:31.110 --> 18:35.340
She was nice, beautiful, always smiling...

18:35.720 --> 18:36.590
I'm sorry.

18:37.450 --> 18:44.170
So the thought that you only 
remember her looking sad...

18:44.630 --> 18:45.560
It doesn't seem right.

18:48.060 --> 18:51.060
It's been five years. It's okay.

18:53.010 --> 18:55.580
I'm scared, okay?

18:56.480 --> 18:57.840
Of changing.

18:58.490 --> 19:00.680
Of forgetting what I did in letting her die.

19:01.430 --> 19:03.320
Of being fulfilled by something else.

19:04.530 --> 19:08.440
Of her slipping out of my memory.

19:09.970 --> 19:13.180
That's why I don't want to change.

19:19.840 --> 19:22.510
Memories aren't a prison.

19:25.660 --> 19:28.530
I'm going to study abroad.

19:29.630 --> 19:32.180
I'll study fashion in France.

19:32.770 --> 19:35.370
There's a place I've always wanted to go,

19:35.370 --> 19:37.550
and I finally passed their exam.

19:38.360 --> 19:41.630
Big Sis always encouraged 
me with that stuff...

19:42.210 --> 19:43.710
So I came to tell her I made it.

19:46.160 --> 19:48.250
Why not live your own life, too?

19:48.250 --> 19:51.260
That'd make her way more happy 
than anything else you could do.

19:53.620 --> 19:56.170
Make her happy, huh?

19:56.490 --> 19:57.720
Yeah.

19:57.720 --> 20:00.130
As her little sister, I guarantee it!

20:01.980 --> 20:03.940
Damn, that ain't fair.

20:05.400 --> 20:07.530
The rain stopped! Finally!

20:09.720 --> 20:12.470
I hear you took in a relative's kid?

20:12.470 --> 20:14.570
Huh? How'd you kno—

20:14.570 --> 20:16.600
Oh, right, Kyu-chan.

20:16.600 --> 20:19.480
That four-eyed blabbermouth...

20:20.510 --> 20:22.800
It's really not a big deal.

20:22.800 --> 20:24.880
She just fell into my lap.

20:24.880 --> 20:26.580
That's cool, too! Having fun?

20:26.580 --> 20:29.400
Nah, she's just a huge handful.

20:29.400 --> 20:31.620
She doesn't do a thing I tell her.

20:31.620 --> 20:35.240
Well, I know you can make her happy, too!

20:42.000 --> 20:45.260
Hey, the sun's out!

20:53.230 --> 20:54.670
Ah, well.

20:55.060 --> 20:57.130
Guess I'll work at it a bit longer.

21:07.050 --> 21:08.470
I'm back.

21:09.470 --> 21:11.790
I'm home, you guys.

21:13.790 --> 21:16.790
Yeah, that's about what I expected.

21:29.140 --> 21:30.760
<b>Medicine - to be taken by mouth</b>

21:42.400 --> 21:45.270
Is this... French toast?

21:45.270 --> 21:46.990
Eat it! Eat it!

21:52.940 --> 21:54.060
Is it good?

21:54.060 --> 21:54.680
Well?

21:57.530 --> 22:01.540
I'm gonna teach you suckers 
what good French toast is!

22:03.290 --> 22:04.730
What now, Miri?

22:04.730 --> 22:08.020
Papa Rei, you said you could do it!

22:08.020 --> 22:09.300
That's right, Miri!

22:12.990 --> 22:14.560
An umbrella!

22:14.830 --> 22:17.050
Rainy-rainy day-day!

22:17.050 --> 22:18.930
My papas are both here!

22:18.930 --> 22:21.020
We're all the best of friends

22:21.020 --> 22:22.570
and we're all home, so let's cheer!

22:22.570 --> 22:24.790
Wishy-washy, splishy-splashy!

22:24.790 --> 22:26.830
La, la, la!

22:29.950 --> 22:35.000
<i>The scenery never changes and 
every day is full of surprises</i>

22:35.000 --> 22:39.460
<i>But those are the best parts</i>

22:39.460 --> 22:44.210
<i>Wrapped around your finger 
and going in circles</i>

22:44.460 --> 22:49.090
<i>These days are dizzying yet endearing</i>

22:49.300 --> 22:53.640
<i>On your restless nights, 
I softly whisper a lullaby</i>

22:53.640 --> 22:58.390
<i>And stroke your hair to the 
rhythm of your breathing</i>

22:58.850 --> 23:02.980
<i>I just want these days to 
continue as long as possible</i>

23:02.980 --> 23:07.990
<i>Even if it's just a day</i>

23:08.780 --> 23:13.700
<i>I chased after you as you ran barefoot</i>

23:13.700 --> 23:17.910
<i>Maybe one day, you'll surpass me, ah</i>

23:17.910 --> 23:22.580
<i>I wonder what tomorrow's going to be like</i>

23:22.580 --> 23:27.510
<i>Why don't we walk together?</i>

23:27.510 --> 23:32.260
<i>This will always be our place to come home to</i>

23:32.760 --> 23:37.060
<i>And it'll shine down on our sadness</i>

23:37.060 --> 23:41.730
<i>That's all right, yeah, that's okay</i>

23:41.730 --> 23:46.650
<i>Let's try to share our love together</i>

23:46.650 --> 23:50.070
<i>Let the light always shine upon hope</i>

23:50.070 --> 23:56.580
<i>When the future is unpredictable</i>
